edia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"A rotation movie of Pluto based on images from NASA's New Horizons","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APluto_rotation_movie2.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Pluto%E2%80%99s_Heart_-_Like_a_Cosmic_Lava_Lamp.jpg/500px-Pluto%E2%80%99s_Heart_-_Like_a_Cosmic_Lava_Lamp.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Pluto%E2%80%99s_Heart_-_Like_a_Cosmic_Lava_Lamp.jpg/1280px-Pluto%E2%80%99s_Heart_-_Like_a_Cosmic_Lava_Lamp.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Pluto%E2%80%99s_Heart_-_Like_a_Cosmic_Lava_Lamp.jpg/500px-Pluto%E2%80%99s_Heart_-_Like_a_Cosmic_Lava_Lamp.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sputnik Planitia is covered with churning nitrogen ice \"cells\" that are geologically young and turning over due to convection.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APluto%E2%80%99s_Heart_-_Like_a_Cosmic_Lava_Lamp.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Pluto-01_Stern_03_Pluto_Color_TXT.jpg/250px-Pluto-01_Stern_03_Pluto_Color_TXT.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Pluto-01_Stern_03_Pluto_Color_TXT.jpg/500px-Pluto-01_Stern_03_Pluto_Color_TXT.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Pluto-01_Stern_03_Pluto_Color_TXT.jpg/250px-Pluto-01_Stern_03_Pluto_Color_TXT.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APluto-01_Stern_03_Pluto_Color_TXT.jpg"}],"sounds":{"Pluto":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"ht